Q: Get value from data set returning undefined A: <p>The main problem you are facing here is <code>forexBopCategory</code> is an object, not a list. The reason why you are getting undefined error.</p>
<p>Try the below code</p>
<pre><code>// Source - https://stackoverflow.com/q/79876961
// Posted by RRB
// Retrieved 2026-01-27, License - CC BY-SA 4.0

this.formData.documentShortDescription = response.forexBOPCategory?.forexBOPCategoryDocumentsList[0].documentShortDescription;

this.formData.rulingOrSubcategoryDescription = response.forexBOPCategory?.rulingOrSubcategoryDescription;
</code></pre>
